b_paragraph\" >All the Apps You Need Are At Your Fingertips!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use the Map app to avoid getting lost on the island.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place all your orders through Betrendy and wait for your delivery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share photos On Onstagram.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase music from Sotify and enjoy playing it on your beach.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Participate in surprise auctions or start your own with the Trader app.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Track your employees and their salaries, your menu and prices, payments, and everything else related to your beach with the MyBeach app.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >As you earn money, you can buy luxury cars and sell them through negotiations.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Approaching the top, you can discover alternative ways to earn money and purchase the yacht and mansion of your dreams.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2856030/extras/b2e33ec582b766e68f28fe315a8a6acd.poster.avif?t=1728923688\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2856030/extras/b2e33ec582b766e68f28fe315a8a6acd.webm?t=1728923688\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2856030/extras/b2e33ec582b766e68f28fe315a8a6acd.mp4?t=1728923688\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Will you be able to fulfill your family's unfinished